{
  "uid": "streamclone-archive",
  "title": "Streamclone Archive",
  "tags": ["streamclone", "archive", "bearhost"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 6,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "description": "BearHost VPS corpus progress — bronze roster, silver/gold backfill, scraper health.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## BearHost corpus pipeline\n**Bronze** — Helix VOD index + TwitchTracker channel summary per roster channel.\n**Silver** — per-stream viewer charts (Camoufox scraper, dedicated silver worker).\n**Gold** — selective GQL VOD chat → Azure (dedicated gold worker, runs concurrently with silver).\n\nCompletion **%** = roster indexed ÷ target (bronze) or **confirmed Azure exports** ÷ total jobs (silver/gold). All metrics from `analytics-workers`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Completion",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Bronze roster",
      "description": "Distinct channels in bronze_index_state vs roster target",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 40 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 70 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 90 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * max(bronze_channels_roster_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\"}) / clamp_min(max(bronze_channels_target{job=\"analytics-workers\"}), 1)",
        "legendFormat": "bronze %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Silver exports",
      "description": "Silver backfill jobs with confirmed Azure export",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 25 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 60 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * max(corpus_tier_completion_ratio{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"silver\",measure=\"export_confirmed\"})",
        "legendFormat": "silver confirmed %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Gold exports",
      "description": "Gold backfill jobs with confirmed Azure export",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0%",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * max(corpus_tier_completion_ratio{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"gold\",measure=\"export_confirmed\"})",
        "legendFormat": "gold confirmed %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Queue snapshot",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bronze channels",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(bronze_channels_roster_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "indexed",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(bronze_channels_target{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "target",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Silver queued",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 200 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 400 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(backfill_jobs_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"silver\",status=\"queued\"})",
        "legendFormat": "queued",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Silver running",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(backfill_jobs_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"silver\",status=\"running\"})",
        "legendFormat": "running",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Silver failed",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(backfill_jobs_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"silver\",status=\"failed\"})",
        "legendFormat": "failed",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gold queued",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0 } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(backfill_jobs_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"gold\",status=\"queued\"}) or vector(0)",
        "legendFormat": "queued",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Workers",
      "description": "Prometheus scrape of analytics-workers /metrics",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(up{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
        "legendFormat": "workers",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trends",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Backfill queue by tier",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }, "fillOpacity": 25 },
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum by (tier, status) (backfill_jobs_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
        "legendFormat": "{{tier}} {{status}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bronze roster growth",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0 } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(bronze_channels_roster_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "channels indexed",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(bronze_channels_target{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "target",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Scraper & gold health",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "collapsed": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gold oldest queued age",
      "description": "Primary gold health signal — age of oldest queued gold job",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1800 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3600 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max(backfill_oldest_queued_age_seconds{job=\"analytics-workers\",tier=\"gold\"}) or vector(0)",
        "legendFormat": "age",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Stale running jobs",
      "description": "Running jobs older than BACKFILL_STALE_RUNNING_AFTER lease",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(backfill_stale_running_gauge{job=\"analytics-workers\"}) or vector(0)",
        "legendFormat": "stale",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TT scraper error % (15m)",
      "description": "Legacy aggregate; see TT scrape health row below for failure reason breakdown",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * sum(rate(analytics_scraper_requests_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",result=\"error\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(analytics_scraper_requests_total{job=\"analytics-workers\"}[15m])), 0.001)",
        "legendFormat": "error %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TT success / min",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cpm", "decimals": 1 } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "60 * sum(rate(analytics_scraper_requests_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",result=\"success\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "success/min",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active sync jobs",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0 } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum(analytics_sync_active{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
        "legendFormat": "active",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GQL pages / min",
      "description": "Gold-tier VOD chat fetch rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 25 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cpm", "decimals": 1, "noValue": "0" } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "60 * sum(rate(analytics_vod_gql_pages_fetched_total{job=\"analytics-workers\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "pages/min",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Backfill worker ticks",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "dateTimeFromNow" } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "backfill_worker_last_tick_timestamp{job=\"analytics-workers\"} * 1000",
        "legendFormat": "{{worker}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Oldest queued age by tier",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0 } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "max by (tier) (backfill_oldest_queued_age_seconds{job=\"analytics-workers\"})",
        "legendFormat": "{{tier}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Scraper requests / sec",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(analytics_scraper_requests_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Archive uploads / min",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 36 },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "60 * sum by (artifact_type) (rate(archive_exports_confirmed_total{job=\"analytics-workers\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{artifact_type}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "TT scrape health (taxonomy)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 43 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TT failures by reason / min",
      "description": "Classified failure reasons from analytics_tt_scrape_failures_total",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 44 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }, "fillOpacity": 30 },
          "unit": "cpm",
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "60 * sum by (reason) (rate(analytics_tt_scrape_failures_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TT success rate %",
      "description": "Success vs all classified attempts (success + failures counters)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 44 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 75 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * sum(rate(analytics_tt_scrape_success_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(analytics_tt_scrape_success_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[15m])) + sum(rate(analytics_tt_scrape_failures_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[15m])), 0.001)",
        "legendFormat": "success %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TT scrape duration p95 (s)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 52 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 1 } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, path, outcome) (rate(analytics_tt_scrape_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[15m])))",
        "legendFormat": "{{path}} {{outcome}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TT cache hit rate (15m)",
      "description": "Browser scrapes served from scraper cache vs fresh navigation",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 52 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 40 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "100 * sum(rate(analytics_tt_scrape_success_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\",path=\"browser\",cache_hit=\"true\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(analytics_tt_scrape_success_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\",path=\"browser\"}[15m])), 0.001)",
        "legendFormat": "cache %",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TT success by path / min",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 52 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cpm", "decimals": 2 } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "expr": "60 * sum by (path) (rate(analytics_tt_scrape_success_total{job=\"analytics-workers\",source=\"twitchtracker\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{path}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    }
  ]
}
